entryFeeText:
Members: $33 by 11/11; $43 by 11/14; $48 at the site;
Non-members: $40 by 11/11; $50 by 11/14; $55 at the site;
Free entry for (W)FMs, (W)IMs, (W)GMs – entry fees deducted from prizes. The field is limited to the first 50 registrants.

Early entry (by 11:59PM Tuesday prior): $40; (Non-HCC Member: Additional $10 Fee); Free Early entry for titled players (GMs, IMs and NMs) with no entry fee deducted from prize;
then Early entry (by 11:59PM Thursday prior): All players $50, then
Regular entry (by 9:00AM day of tournament, two hours before Rd 1): All players $60

